{"track":"r","category":"함수형 도구","level":4,"title":"함수 합성","desc":"<p><code>compose(f, g)</code>를 만드세요. <code>f</code>와 <code>g</code>를 합친 <b>새 함수</b>를 돌려주는데, 그 함수는 입력 <code>x</code>에 대해 <code>f(g(x))</code>를 계산해요.</p>","starter":"compose <- function(f, g) {\n  \n}\n","solution":"compose <- function(f, g) {\n  function(x) f(g(x))\n}\n","hint":"<p>함수를 돌려주는 함수(클로저)예요. 안쪽에서 <code>f</code>, <code>g</code>를 기억해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"compose(sqrt, abs)(-9)","expected":3,"visible":true},{"call":"compose(function(v) v + 1, function(v) v * 2)(5)","expected":11,"visible":true},{"call":"compose(toupper, trimws)(\"  hi \")","expected":"HI","visible":false},{"call":"compose(length, unique)(c(1, 1, 2))","expected":2,"visible":false}],"id":"r-527"}